OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start today, becoming
OL,6,Fincreasingly murky and mild as patchy
OL,7,Frain arrives in the west during the
OL,8,Fmorning. Some heavy outbreaks arrive
OL,9,Fhere later, but most eastern areas
OL,10,Fwill remain dry. Breezy in the west,
OL,11,Fparticularly along coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA murky night with heavy
OL,14,Fspells of rain, and fog pushing
OL,15,Finland. Breezy, with strong winds
OL,16,Falong southern coasts. Feeling much
OL,17,Fmilder than Saturday night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
