OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FMurky with areas of patchy
OL,6,Frain which may be heavy in the
OL,7,Fmorning. Becoming breezy, with some
OL,8,Fstrong gusts later, but feeling very
OL,9,Fmild with temperatures reaching the
OL,10,Fhigh-teens.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FStrong
OL,13,Fwinds during Tuesday morning but after
OL,14,Fpassing showers it will become
OL,15,Fbrighter and cooler. Breezy during
OL,16,FWednesday with sunny spells, then
OL,17,Fincreasingly cloudy, showery and windy
OL,18,Fthrough Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
